**STEP 2 verdict: PASS.** 12 EAPOL frames — **two complete and independent EAP conversations**,
interleaved on the one wire, each with its own Request/Identity, its own MD5-Challenge, its own
digest (`7e2549…` and `9c9acd…`, different, as they must be since the challenges differ) and its
own `EAP-Success`, both completing in 1.03 s. Against step 0's 7 frames and one silent supplicant,
on the same port, with the same tool, in the same session.

