state, not a single port flag.

### STEP 3 — the CONTROL, in the same window: a third MAC with a bad password is refused while both good ones succeed

All three supplicants in **one** invocation, so the control is not merely in the same run but in
the same 1.04-second packet window as the legs it controls for.

```
tools/tb sudotool tb277 dot1x1304 eapol eth4 \
    --supplicant 02:0d:b9:00:33:60:ckmulti1:ckmulti1pw:success \
    --supplicant 02:0d:b9:00:33:61:ckmulti2:ckmulti2pw:success \
    --supplicant 02:0d:b9:00:33:6f:ckmulti1:WRONGPASSWORD9:failure \
